MLX (https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx)
Copyright © 2023 Apple Inc.
MIT License (same terms as above)

  src/mj_mlx/qmv_rows.py generates a Metal kernel that mirrors the arithmetic of MLX's qmv_fast
  kernel (4-bit, group size 64) for 2-4 rows. src/mj_mlx/qmm_small.py builds its kernel at run time
  against the steel BlockMMA / BlockLoader / QuantizedBlockLoader headers of the user's installed MLX; those headers
  are read from the MLX installation and are not copied into this repository.

