Hugging Face transformers (https://github.com/huggingface/transformers)
Copyright The Qwen team, Alibaba Group and the HuggingFace Inc. team, and the respective model authors
Apache License, Version 2.0

  src/mj_mlx/qwen3_5_moe.py and gated_delta.py are written from
  models/qwen3_5_moe/modeling_qwen3_5_moe.py. Changes: MLX reimplementation for flat varlen steps with paged KV and
  per-request recurrent-state slots, folded zero-centered RMSNorm weights, fused projections, a Metal
  gated-delta-rule kernel, vectorized causal conv, optional float32 residual and router.

  src/mj_mlx/moe_lm.py is written from the modeling files of mixtral, qwen2_moe, qwen3_moe, olmoe,
  deepseek_v2, deepseek_v3 and glm4_moe. Changes: one configurable MLX model over one flat varlen step with paged KV;
  MLA attention as single-head attention over the latent cache (weight absorption); routers in float32.

