Evaluation data (not code; used by tools/mlx_lm_eval.py and tools/mlx_accuracy_ppl.py)

  results/accuracy/mmlu_subset.jsonl: 1,140 questions and dev examples from MMLU (Hendrycks et al.), via the Hugging
  Face dataset cais/mmlu. MIT License. Changes: a seeded subset of 20 test questions per subject with 5 dev shots each.

  results/accuracy/gsm8k_subset.jsonl: 250 problems and 5 training examples from GSM8K (Cobbe et al., OpenAI), via the
  Hugging Face dataset openai/gsm8k. MIT License. Changes: a seeded subset.

  results/accuracy/wiki.test.raw: the WikiText-2 raw test split (Merity et al.), via Salesforce/wikitext. Creative
  Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 (CC BY-SA 3.0). Changes: rows joined into one text.

